  stepId: Step_05_InstallRoles
  instructionText: "LO2.3 - Install the modules the job order requires.\n\nOpen Server
    Manager \u2014 Start menu or desktop. Click Manage \u25BE (or the numbered tile
    \"2 Add roles and features\") and step through the wizard to the Server Roles
    page.\n\nTick all five roles the job order asks for:\n\nActive Directory Domain
    Services\nDHCP Server\nDNS Server\nFile and Storage Services\nPrint and Document
    Services\n\nClick Next through the remaining pages, then Install."
